1
00:00:03,203 --> 00:00:05,519
Choose Add Widget, then Report.

2
00:00:05,519 --> 00:00:10,463
Position, Width and Height place the tile on the dashboard, and the Title

3
00:00:10,463 --> 00:00:12,153
is the name above it.

4
00:00:12,605 --> 00:00:17,076
Report lists every report you may view under Reports, by category.

5
00:00:17,076 --> 00:00:20,865
Here it is Queue service level, from Queue and Routing.

6
00:00:21,315 --> 00:00:24,963
Period is the stretch of time the widget covers:

7
00:00:24,963 --> 00:00:29,693
Today and Yesterday, the last 7, 30 or 90 days, this month, last

8
00:00:29,693 --> 00:00:34,828
month, this year, the last 12 months, All time, or Custom dates, which

9
00:00:34,828 --> 00:00:37,395
asks for a first and a last day.

10
00:00:37,846 --> 00:00:40,974
Show chooses what of the report appears:

11
00:00:40,974 --> 00:00:46,416
figures and tables, figures only, tables only, charts only, or everything.

12
00:00:46,886 --> 00:00:49,617
Rows per table limits a long table.

13
00:00:49,617 --> 00:00:54,148
Keep for sets how many minutes the widget keeps what it shows.

14
00:00:54,148 --> 00:00:56,946
Zero runs the report on every visit.

15
00:00:57,398 --> 00:00:58,690
Click Publish.

16
00:00:58,690 --> 00:01:01,531
The widget joins the dashboard editor.

17
00:01:01,531 --> 00:01:03,856
Add a second one the same way:

18
00:01:03,856 --> 00:01:07,408
Call insights, for the last 7 days, figures only.

